{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27420","headline":"哭韩将军 · 顾非熊","name":"哭韩将军","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将军不复见仪形，笑语随风入杳冥。\n战马旧骑嘶引葬，歌姬新嫁哭辞灵。\n功勳客问求爲志，服玩僧收与转经。\n寂寞一家春色里，百花开落满山庭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾非熊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27420.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27420","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}